01:02:32.918 --> 01:02:34.582
with the third best
talk of the conference.

01:02:34.582 --> 01:02:36.398
(audience laughs)

01:02:36.398 --> 01:02:40.044
All of that stuff, is
so stunningly secondary,

01:02:40.044 --> 01:02:44.385
