01:04:12.968 --> 01:04:14.400
Then go talk to someone new.

01:04:14.400 --> 01:04:16.070
Talk to everyone in this conference

01:04:16.070 --> 01:04:19.144
'cause VidSummit 2017 is lit.

01:04:19.144 --> 01:04:20.217
I'm not gonna dab.

01:04:20.217 --> 01:04:21.586
Alright, that's that guys.

01:04:21.586 --> 01:04:24.741
Have a great lunch, go find
food, talk to everyone.

01:04:24.741 --> 01:04:25.574
